---
import Preview from '../Preview.astro';
---
<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[var(--border)]" id="logistics">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">

<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--logistics-primary)]">For logistics teams</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-4 tracking-tight">
            Plan pickups and deliveries
          </h2>

<div class="bg-[var(--logistics-tint)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] rounded-lg p-3.5 mb-6 flex items-start gap-2.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
<p class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--logistics-primary)]">Coordinate parcel receiving, sorting, and dispatch from a dedicated operations workspace.</p>
</div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed mb-6">Logistics access requires Admin approval. Couriers require approval by their associated Logistics organization.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
                Parcel receiving
              </div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)]">Receive and sort parcels.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
                Pickup and delivery planning
              </div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)]">Plan pickup and delivery schedules.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
                Affiliated couriers
              </div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)]">Coordinate approved affiliated couriers through the Rider mobile app.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg>
                Courier approval
              </div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)]">Couriers use the Rider mobile app. Seller and Logistics workflows are available through their dedicated web portals.</p>
</div>
</div>
<a class="min-h-[44px] px-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--logistics-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--logistics-hover)] text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--logistics-primary)] focus-visible:outline-none" href="https://logistics.aisley.app" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span>Open logistics portal</span>
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm"><div class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mb-4">Logistics dispatch workspace</div><Preview src="/screens/logistics.webp" title="Logistics dispatch workspace" width={780} height={437} /></div></div>
</div></section>
